    "rich_text_9y7zjW": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_G7k84L": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Explore Our Variety of Restaurant Table Candles",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-2-base"
          }
        },
        "text_tHi7yF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We carry a wide selection of restaurant table candles to meet the needs of all types of restaurants. The Bolsius candles we sell are fashioned from high-quality unscented wax and cotton wicks, so there's never a hint of smoke or odor. Here's a closer look at the kinds of candles you'll find in our collection:</p><ul><li><strong>Taper Candles: </strong>Perfect for formal settings, our elegant taper candles provide a classic, refined look. They're ideal for intimate dinners where presentation is paramount, casting a long, flickering flame that adds sophistication to any meal.</li><li><strong>Pillar Candles:</strong> These durable candles make a statement with their substantial size and stand-alone appeal. Best used as centerpieces or arranged in clusters for a bold impact, pillar candles offer prolonged burn times and a strong presence on large tables or outdoor settings.</li><li><strong>Tea Lights:</strong> Small in size but mighty in ambiance, tea lights are the go-to choice for creating a subtle and inviting glow. Their compact form makes them ideal for dotting along pathways, adding to table spreads, or enhancing secondary spaces like bar tops and bathrooms.</li><li><strong>Votive Candles:</strong> Encased in decorative holders, votive candles serve as excellent accents to any decor theme. They provide a soft, diffused light that is perfect for intimate table settings, enhancing the vibe of your dining environment without overpowering it.</li></ul>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_G7k84L",
        "text_tHi7yF"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "alignment": "left_left",
        "enable_animation": true,
        "divider_style": "none",
        "section_padding": "section--vertical-padding-top-bottom",
        "content_width": "custom",
        "custom_content_width": 700
      }
    },
    "rich_text_9mqHK4": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_GLd4Pt": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why Ours Are the Best Candles for Restaurants",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-2-base"
          }
        },
        "text_H8bBxW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The quality of your candles matters when creating the perfect dining atmosphere. Bolsius candles from Kisco cater to the needs of the hospitality industry. These candles are unscented, ensuring they don't interfere with the aroma of your food. Additionally, they burn cleanly and are smokeless and dripless, maintaining the elegance of your settings without any mess. Here are more advantages to putting our candles on the dining table:</p><h3></h3><p></p><p></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_dVbGbT": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_MNeAXT": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Bulk Buying Benefits",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_DcrApL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Purchasing table candles in bulk from Kisco allows you to manage costs more effectively by lowering the price per unit, which is essential for businesses looking to optimize their operational expenses. Furthermore, bulk purchasing ensures you always have an ample supply of restaurant candles on hand, which is crucial to maintain consistency in service and ambiance without last-minute shortages.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_cdW8Hj": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_YQFh4W": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Benefits of Our Wholesale Program",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_hXTtd4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Joining our <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/pages/wholesale\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">wholesale program</span></a> extends additional benefits beyond cost savings. Kisco's wholesale program provides access to exclusive deals, priority customer service, and flexible ordering options tailored to your business needs. This program supports your business's growth by ensuring you have the resources you need when you need them, allowing you to focus on delivering exceptional guest experiences.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
