            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_MYx7NP": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Are these candles safe to use around food and beverages?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_xHdnBk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Absolutely. Bolsius candles are made with high-quality waxes that burn cleanly, ensuring they're safe to use around food and beverages without affecting their flavor or aroma.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_dUKKc3": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_yLyByW": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "How long do Bolsius candles typically burn?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_3Rk76B": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Bolsius candles are designed for long-lasting burn times, which vary depending on the size and type of candle. This makes them ideal for restaurant settings where candles may need to be lit for extended periods.<em> Burn times for each candle type are included in the product details.</em></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_X8VFfc": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_U3mpic": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "How can I save on candles for my restaurant?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_86qRTJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Buying in bulk through Kisco offers significant savings, reducing the cost per candle and helping manage your restaurant's operational budget more effectively.</p>",
